  "name": "Start",
  "comment": "snapshot: a run's exact state, saved to a file or a store and gone on with later, even after its program changed or\nthe program moved where it goes on. This goal is the plan's index and its proof: each comment a behaviour we want,\nand the step under it runs the plang test that proves it; a behaviour proved only in C# names its test. The text is\nstart.md.",
