          "index": 0,
          "text": "call /plan/snapshot/module/snapshot/resume/FreshAppGoesOn",
          "line": {
            "number": 21,
            "indent": 0
          },
          "comment": "a run saved inside a goal it called, kept in a file and resumed, goes on from its save in an app of its own: the\ncalled goal finishes, its caller goes on after the call, and nothing before the save runs again",
          "code": [
            {
              "module": "goal",
              "name": "call",
              "property": [
                {
                  "name": "Name",
                  "type": {
