          "index": 1,
          "text": "call /plan/snapshot/module/snapshot/resume/EventComesBack",
          "line": {
            "number": 25,
            "indent": 0
          },
          "comment": "a call saved mid-step is finished, then the rest of its step runs once — never the call again — C# test\nSnapshotResumeTests (SnapshotResume_InsideACall_FinishesIt_ThenTheRestOfTheCallingStep_Once)\na run saved inside a bound call keeps %!event%: resumed, it reads what the event fired for",
          "code": [
            {
              "module": "goal",
              "name": "call",
              "property": [
                {
                  "name": "Name",
