          "line": {
            "number": 31,
            "indent": 0
          },
          "comment": "a goal changed since the save is the goal as it is now: the run goes on at its saved place, and another action\nstanding there is said on the error channel — C# tests CallSnapshotTests\n(Call_Resume_AStepInsertedWhereTheRunStopped_RunsIt_ThenTheStepItStoppedIn, Call_Resume_AnotherActionAtThePlace_GoesOnThere_AndSaysSo)\na resume's app is a sub app of the resuming actor: a binding the resuming app made, which the snapshot never held,\nfires in the resumed run",
          "code": [
